2026-10-31  Everton Vilhena Cardoso

	Release 1.5.4: defects found by the test lab.

	* openalloy/resources/60-openalloy.rules: Match on the hidraw node
	through IMPORT{builtin}="usb_id" and ID_VENDOR_ID, ID_MODEL_ID,
	ID_USB_INTERFACE_NUM (interfaces 02 and 03 only).
	* openalloy/application/engine.py (_set_mode): Reopen the device when
	leaving fixed mode for onboard, so the release reaches the firmware.
	(_onboard_replugged): New; notice a replug in onboard mode.
	* openalloy/presentation/gui/app.py: Deliver replies with
	GLib.PRIORITY_DEFAULT.  (_show_lighting): Wait for the initial data.
	* openalloy/presentation/cli/main.py (preset delete): Fail on a
	missing preset.
	* openalloy/infra/drivers.py (_try_vendor): Log a refusal once.
	* lab/: New test lab.
	* tests/test_udev_rules.py, tests/test_fixes_1_5_4.py,
	tests/test_gui_priority.py: New.

2026-10-30  Everton Vilhena Cardoso

	Release 1.5.3: suspend with frozen user services, service shutdown,
	English-only journal, RPC queue limits, CLI fixes.

	* openalloy/resources/openalloy-sleep: Do not talk to frozen user
	services; short timeout; send the time of the notice.
	* openalloy/application/engine.py (_check_resume, boottime): Detect a
	resume from the clocks; ignore a stale sleep notice.
	* openalloy/presentation/daemon/main.py: Lock-free signal handlers.
	* openalloy/infra/rpc.py: Byte-bounded output queue; shutdown race.
	* openalloy/i18n/__init__.py (Message): Lazily translated messages.
	* openalloy/infra/logging_config.py: Log errors in English.

